---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="About Us">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-[#1C2354] mb-6">About Us</h1>
    <p class="text-lg mb-4">Dignified Future Initiative (DFI) is a private company limited by guarantee (RC 9861744), established to promote education, leadership development, youth empowerment, and civil engagement in Nigeria and beyond.</p>
    <p class="text-lg mb-4">Our mission is to create pathways for a dignified future by providing training, mentorship, and advocacy that bridge the gap between young people and the policy decisions that affect them.</p>
    <p class="text-lg">We are registered as a non-profit organization and operate with a focus on transparency, community impact, and sustainable development.</p>
  </div>
</Layout>
